# Who must approve a change to main. Branch protection: "Require review from Code Owners" and the required check
# separation-of-duties (scripts/approval_check.py: an owner other than the requester, author or committers approves,
# on the current commit). The last matching line wins.
#
# Test bed: one account stands in for each team, so one approval covers both roles. In the bank, use teams:
#   AI platform   @<org>/ai-platform     everything by default, and the pipelines and checks themselves
#   Model risk    @<org>/model-risk      each model's governance record
# (Team owners need the check's token to read team membership: a GitHub App token, not the workflow token.)

*                                                       @dreadnaught07

# AI platform: pipelines, checks and this file. A change to the check is approved like any other change.
/.github/                                               @dreadnaught07
/scripts/                                               @dreadnaught07

# Model risk: tier, AICOE tier record, AIIA, people impact, sponsor, intake request.
/gateway/foundry-accounts/*/models/*/governance.yaml    @dreadnaught07
